# Test fixtures are binary — EOL normalization would corrupt PDF xref byte
# offsets and the UTF-16 BOM. Never apply text/CRLF conversion to them.
*.pdf binary
# DOCX/XLSX/ZIP fixtures are OOXML/zip containers (and one CFBF/OLE2 stub) — the
# same EOL/CRLF normalization that corrupts a PDF would corrupt their zip records
# and magic bytes. Guard them as binary so git stores the exact bytes.
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
test/fixtures/utf16le.txt binary
